                <mxCell id="f08-note1" value="A conflict with a reason while the policy disables overbooking is refused (409); the booking stays Under Review. Bookings attached to an event proposal never reach this queue: they move with the proposal (submit → Under Review, approve → Approved after a conflict check, revision → Revision Requested, reject → Released). Event cancellation or reschedule, club suspension (future Approved bookings) and dissolution release or cancel bookings automatically." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;spacingLeft=10;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
